PCI ID database

This package distributes pci.ids from the PCI ID Project without changes.
The file's own header names its maintainers and states that it can be
distributed under either the GNU General Public License (version 2 or higher)
or the 3-clause BSD License. Pyxis distributes it under the 3-clause BSD
License. The header also states that the database is a compilation of factual
data whose copyright covers the aggregation and formatting, held by Martin Mares
and Albert Pool.

The upstream repository does not include a separate license file. LICENSE in
this directory is the standard 3-clause BSD text with the copyright holders
named in that header. The complete upstream header remains in pci.ids.

Upstream data and project:
https://github.com/pciutils/pciids
https://pci-ids.ucw.cz/

share/pciids/source.txt records the pinned commit and database version.
